  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> All Ranged Weapons capable of Autofire that expend 20 or more rounds when using Autofire</p>\n<p><em>“Aim down your sights, doomba! You’re spraying rounds all over the damn place! And space out your bursts, you’re wasting ammo!”</em></p>\n<p>The weapon now expends 10 rounds when using Autofire. If it previously expended more than 20 rounds, the amount of rounds it expends for Autofire is halved (Round Up).</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Weapon Mods).</em></p>"
